## 🛠 Technologies Used

### Backend

* Python 3.x
* Flask
* Scikit-learn

### Data Processing

* Pandas
* NumPy

### Data Visualization

* Matplotlib
* Seaborn

### Frontend

* HTML5
* CSS3
* Bootstrap 5
* JavaScript

### Machine Learning

* Random Forest Classifier
* Logistic Regression
* K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN)

